Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 20 life and control two Goblin Pikers, Frogify (enchanting the opponent's Siege-Gang Commander) and 22 untapped Volcanic Islands. Your hand is Clone and Phantasmal Image. The opponent is at 18 life and controls an untapped Serra Angel, a tapped Siege-Gang Commander enchanted by your Frogify, a tapped Craw Wurm with three +1/+1 counters and two untapped Plains. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-niche-layers-copy | A copy effect uses only the copiable values (CR 707.2, 613.2a): Frogify's type, ability and P/T changes (layers 4, 6, 7b) are not copied, so Phantasmal Image and Clone each become a full Siege-Gang Commander, with its enters trigger and its sacrifice ability, while a copy of the Wurm would drop its counters and a copy of the Angel is summoning sick; 2 Pikers past one blocker deal 2, and the 8 Goblins sacrificed deal 16: 18
